WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.122
We will begin with the basic difference between long and wide data.

00:00:04.122 --> 00:00:10.372
Then we will learn how to pivot, which means turning selected row categories into columns.

00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:16.671
After that, we will reverse the process and un pivot wide columns back into rows.

00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:25.828
Next, we will focus on grain, because grain is the main protection against accidental double counting and information

00:00:25.828 --> 00:00:27.048
loss.

00:00:27.048 --> 00:00:34.948
Finally, we will validate reshaped results and decide whether long or wide form is better for reporting, visualization,

00:00:34.948 --> 00:00:36.375
or later analysis.
